{"parse": {"title": "小狗与流浪汉-05", "pageid": 89612, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E6%B5%AA%E6%B1%89-04\" title=\"小狗与流浪汉-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">小狗与流浪汉-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E6%B5%AA%E6%B1%89-06\" title=\"小狗与流浪汉-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">小狗与流浪汉</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.8E.89.E9.98.9F.E7.9A.84.E7.90.83.E9.9E.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"掉队的球鞋\">掉队的球鞋</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 掉队的球鞋</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Shoe Left Behind</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0riverside.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0riverside\"><img alt=\"0riverside\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/600px-Cg-0riverside.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/900px-Cg-0riverside.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/1200px-Cg-0riverside.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦……总算到了——河港！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪。<i>&lt;是海鲈鱼的味道。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪。<i>&lt;我想我没有主动接触过这种口味的东西。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，呜呜？<i>&lt;这真神奇，是我的潜意识在作祟吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗感到惊讶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>盟友，尽管惊讶！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>流浪的好处之一——地图存在于我心中！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>作为一只小狗，你要学习的还有很多～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>嗯——<i>&lt;我不明白我们来到这里的原因。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗不熟悉这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦，你没来过这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>那你可亏大了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术扬了扬手中的宣传单碎片，上面的“游轮”与“巴黎”被红色马克笔夸张地标注了一圈又一圈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>热闹的早市传单可从不斟酌人们的消费力，所以无论是什么样的宣传信息，在这里都能找得到～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>所以这张，也一样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的手臂高高抬起，纸片像一条劣质的绶带，被吹得猎猎作响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>下午时分，集市结束后的河港冷冷清清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嗯，虽然我们错过了最佳时间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>但我想总会有十个以上的人懒得把那些花花绿绿的宣传单带回家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>现在是你的回合了，小家伙！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术将破碎的传单一角凑到了小狗的鼻子前面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜，汪汪汪。<i>&lt;先生，这样混杂的气味是无法协助我寻物的。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪汪……<i>&lt;这行为毫无意义，我想您应该多看一些生物相关的科普类书籍……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗帮不上你的忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦——那真遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>那或许你能留意下这附近的纸张？就是这种俗气的洋红色……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜呜，呜……<i>&lt;我的视锥细胞也并不足以支撑我分辨红色……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽吽。<i>&lt;不过我有更有效率的办法。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗缓缓地垂下眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦，原来你是困了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>那就交给我吧盟友，可靠的挖掘艺术打算——从垃圾桶找起！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人动作夸张地转身，全然没注意到身后靛青色的光芒。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜，狺狺……？汪汪汪……<i>&lt;奇怪，我怎么……？感知的力量不听使唤……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺……狺狺，狺狺狺……<i>&lt;传单……是的，我应该瞧瞧传单在……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪……呜……汪汪……吽吽吽？<i>&lt;但是，这是什么……这是……是一双白色的……白色的球鞋吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>温迪，你……怎……一个人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺？<i>&lt;是谁在说话？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>皮克勒斯……丢……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺？<i>&lt;皮克勒斯？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-306310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……狺狺狺？<i>&lt;我……应该熟悉这个名字吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0riverside.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0riverside\"><img alt=\"0riverside\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/600px-Cg-0riverside.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/900px-Cg-0riverside.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-0riverside.png/1200px-Cg-0riverside.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗猛地睁开眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……狺狺。<i>&lt;这……太奇怪了。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺狺……狺狺？<i>&lt;感知术不受我的控制……可我看到的又是什么呢？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>啊哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>埋头在垃圾桶里的男人直起身来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>快过来盟友！瞧瞧我找到了什么！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>这就是完整的传单！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>左边写的什么——哦！充满惊喜的海上之旅，通往巴黎的美妙航船～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>和我们听到的碎片信息没有出入，这是个好消息！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>那么时间是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>今晚？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦，这简直是命运的指引！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术显得干劲十足。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>绝妙的巧合——我的使命！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-306412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>呼，很好！下面是，价格！我看看……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>不，不不……我一定是眼花了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>个，十，百……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-306411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刚被拾起的宣传单又落回了地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>显然，艺术是无价的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>——但艺术的大门有价！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我想这正是使命之路上的必经考验……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我们得想想别的办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>比如……具有艺术性的……偷渡？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦！该说不说，那真浪漫！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪？<i>&lt;嗯？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗的眼里倒映出了宣传单右侧的另一艘宏伟游轮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>嗯？<i>&lt;希腊？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……汪汪汪。<i>&lt;时间也是今晚……我或许可以和这位先生一起行动。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……狺狺。<i>&lt;一艘通往希腊……不，载我归乡的船只。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺狺，狺狺……<i>&lt;登上它的我将变为船中之船，化为一团名为忒休斯的迷雾……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嘿，盟友，你有在听吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>你看上去有点奇怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜，呜呜，汪汪。<i>&lt;抱歉，不知道为什么，我无法停止思考哲学。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>嗯——？<i>&lt;可我为什么要停止思考哲学呢？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嗯？现在已经……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>该死，时间可不多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>让我们祈祷刚才的派对再过一会儿就能转到这个街上来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>当然如果刚好能转到码头……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>很好，没有我的镜面肥皂泡解决不了的艺术难题！\t</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>汪，汪汪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>河对岸传来了声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪？<i>&lt;嗯？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……<i>&lt;很久没有人这么叫我了……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺。<i>&lt;不对。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>皮克勒斯——！小皮克勒斯——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小牧羊犬的耳朵高高地立了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;我认识这个声音。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺狺……<i>&lt;是刚刚感知到的那个……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>盟友？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>他在那儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-611301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>汪、汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……呜呜呜。<i>&lt;不，我不知道苹果派……它对我来说可能太酸了。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪？<i>&lt;太酸了？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>天哪，小皮克勒斯——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>河岸对面的人影十分模糊，但足以让皮克勒斯的尾巴警觉地立了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>獒！獒！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>气喘吁吁的男人旁边，一个小毛球急躁地蹦跶着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>温迪，真的是他！！谢天谢地，总算找到了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>他看起来没事……太好了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>该死，这个河……我过不去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-611210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>小皮克勒斯！你不要动！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人手忙脚乱地摸索着身上的口袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>你看！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>你最喜欢的《哲学史演讲录》——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白色的尾巴尖尖轻轻摇晃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺？<i>&lt;那个人是谁？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜汪汪……<i>&lt;他穿着那双白色的……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，狺狺狺？<i>&lt;噢，他会是那双球鞋的主人吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;他好像很了解我的喜好。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗向河岸靠近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪。嗯……汪汪。<i>&lt;我喜欢他的声音。气味……也还不错。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺，狺狺狺？<i>&lt;他站得太远了，他为什么不过来呢？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>快，盟友，时间不等人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪。<i>&lt;是的，是的，我知道。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗向前走出两步，又回过头转了个圈儿。从喉咙里发出了呜呜的哼叫声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>……小皮克勒斯……我得赶紧过去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜，呜呜……<i>&lt;先生，如果我不是有很重要的事情要继续去做的话……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿焦急地寻找着通往对岸的路。而岸边，黑白色小狗频频回头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>哦，拜托，拜托你千万不要动！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人的声音里带着祈求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但最终，它还是跟着一个不认识的家伙离开了他的视野。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>哦，不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪，呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿怔愣片刻，缓缓蹲坐在地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪汪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿抱着可怜的小斗牛犬，小狗的毛发粘上了鼻涕，变得黏黏糊糊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-611211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>他不要我们了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-611310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "小狗与流浪汉-05"}}